+        # xybrid patch: windows-gnu targets make rustc shell out to `dlltool`
+        # at COMPILE time (#[link(kind = "raw-dylib")] in the modern windows/
+        # windows-sys family). rustc's default lookup (x86_64-w64-mingw32-
